          "additionalInformation": {
            "de": [
              "Dienstag in Villargondran (Parkplatz des Capucin Gourmand)\r\nMittwoch in Hermillon (am Kreisverkehr)\r\nDonnerstag in Sainte-Marie-de-Cuines (vor dem Rathaus)\r\nFreitag in Epierre (gegenüber der Bar-Tabak)\r\nSamstag in Saint-Avre (gegenüber dem Bahnhof)\r\nSonntag in Saint-Remy-de-Maurienne (neben dem Rathaus)"
            ],
            "en": [
              "Tuesday, Villargondran (Capucin Gourmand parking lot)\r\nWednesday in Hermillon (at the traffic circle)\r\nThursday, Sainte-Marie-de-Cuines (in front of the town hall)\r\nFriday in Epierre (opposite the bar-tabac)\r\nSaturday at Saint-Avre (opposite the station)\r\nSunday at Saint-Remy-de-Maurienne (next to the town hall)"
            ],
            "it": [
